00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:04.000
Speaker 1: Let's go next to Bob&nbsp;
from Colorado. Bob, welcome.&nbsp;

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.880
Speaker 3: Hey, Dave, thanks for taking my call.
Speaker 1: Pleasure.&nbsp;

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:11.920
