I'm going to ask about the abortion thing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:19.280
Okay. Do you think this could maybe be. Well, let&nbsp;
me let me let me tell you where I'm coming from.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:26.320
Okay. So I know you mentioned a couple of&nbsp;
times that you think maybe many Republicans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:33.600
don't want to ban abortion or overturn Roe v Wade&nbsp;
because it's such an important fund raising issue.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:40.160
